<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal ind prod rises 0.7 pct yr/yr in Jan.</title>
<headline>Portugal ind prod rises 0.7 pct yr/yr in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's index of industrial production rose 0.7 percent year-on-year in January, while month-on-month it rose 2.5 percent, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>					  Jan 97	Dec 96	Jan 96</p>
<p>General Index			 100.8	  98.3	  100.1</p>
<p>Percentage change yr/yr	    +0.7</p>
<p>Percentage change mo/mo	    +2.5</p>
<p>Accumulated 12 months		+1.2</p>
<p>Base Year = 1985</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
